    {
      "type": "text",
      "title": "What this dashboard shows",
      "id": 30,
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 58,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "\n**RepoMind** answers questions about Java codebases with file:line citations, reviews pull requests\nand serves AI agents over MCP. These panels are its live metrics, scraped by Prometheus from\nSpring Boot Actuator / Micrometer.\n\n* **Cache hit rate**: answers served without spending a model call\n* **Circuit breakers**: Claude → Ollama failover state per provider\n* **Rejected requests**: per-client rate limits and daily token budgets\n\nSource: [github.com/Ayush0612005/repomind](https://github.com/Ayush0612005/repomind)\n"
      }
    }
